<title>UK: Birmingham Midshires -- no decision on conversion.</title>
<headline>Birmingham Midshires -- no decision on conversion.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Birmingham Midshires Building Society, which is at the centre of speculation about a possible takeover and conversion to a bank, said on Tuesday it had made no decision on changing its corporate form.</p>
<p>The mutually-owned group, announcing record 34 million stg interim pre-tax profits, said it expected &quot;another excellent year&quot;.</p>
</text>
